{
  "$schema": "./schema/boost.schema.json",
  "design_notes": [
    "Percentages are stored as fractions: Δv Bonus +1% is op add_fraction, value 0.01. Multipliers (×1.1) are op mul. Money, days and morale points are op add.",
    "Section 11.1 says same-type boosts stack additively up to the cap. For the two multiplier boosts the design does not say whether ×1.1 and ×1.25 stack to ×1.35 or ×1.375; the cap is stored as printed.",
    "Completion fraction f = players who succeeded / active players in the minigame; disconnected players are excluded. Solo play uses the performance score s in [0,1] with the same thresholds. With two players, one success is f = 0.5, which is Bronze."
  ],
